  "description": "Ah-jin, at the prime age for marriage, is preparing to marry her current boyfriend, Joo-won. However, her childhood friend Si-woo, with whom she had a falling out due to a misunderstanding in the past, shows up as a workplace colleague. Ah-jin finds herself gradually seeing Si-woo as a man, drawn to his completely changed appearance from the past.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/bestChallenge/list?titleId=830565)     \n[Official English](https://comics.inkr.com/title/4682-reasons-i-m-drawn-to-you)",
